<title>USA: Chemed says Roto-Rooter merger done.</title>
<headline>Chemed says Roto-Rooter merger done.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemed Corp said on Tuesday that its subsidiary has completed its merger with Roto-Rooter Inc, thereby completing its acquisition of Roto-Rooter's outstanding stock not already held by Chemed.</p>
<p>All shares of Roto-Rooter common stock not previously purchased in Chemed's tender offer were converted in the merger into the right to receive the same $41 per share cash price paid in the tender offer by Chemed. Prior to the merger, Chemed owned about 97 percent of Roto-Rooter.</p>
</text>
